E x 0 4cm and comes within 4 0cm of the deep margin  The remaining uninvolved breast tissue is tan yellow to red and unremarkable fibrofatty tissue  The axillary tail consists of tan red fibrofatty tissue with multiple palpable lymph nodes  and is dissected to reveal multiple lymph nodes ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 2 2cm in greatest dimension  The tissue is serially sectioned and representative sections are submitted as follows  A B  representative sections of the largest mass  with areas closest to margin in cassette A  C D  representative sections of the mass grossly located 1 0cm from posterior resection margin  showing relation of tumor to ink  E  representative section of tumor deep to the superior aspect of the areola  F  small nodule located 4 0cm from the deep resection margin  G  representative section of uninvolved tissue from the medial aspect  H  representative section of uninvolved tissue from the lateral aspect  I  representative section of 11 o clock skin nodule  J  representative section of 12 o clock skin nodule  K O  axillary lymph nodes one per cassette  P  two axillary lymph nodes  Q S  axillary lymph nodes  Resident  JULIE ANN NAGLE  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  W B Jerry Younger  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY , Yes.
